        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kialda Josep mbaret ne kitinyei, inendet ne kitochi che kiyoktoi kainet ne bo aeng’ koguure Barnaba (ne ye kiweech, ko Weritab kagaigaet), Lawindet, chito ne kisalu Kupro, ",
          "type": "text",
